    "id": 8,
    "title": "Lesson 08: Column Widths, Row Heights, AutoFit, and Text Wrapping",
    "slug": "lesson-08-column-widths,-row-heights,-autofit,-and-text-wrapping",
    "category": "excel",
    "category_name": "Excel & Spreadsheets",
    "difficulty": "Beginner",
    "summary": "Fix annoying '###' errors, truncated text, and format multi-line headers with Wrap Text.",
    "content": "# Lesson 08: Column Widths, Row Heights & Text Wrapping\n\nHave you ever seen a cell filled with \\`#####\\`? Don't panic! It simply means your column is too narrow to display the number.\n\n---\n\n## 1. How to Resize Columns & Rows\n1. **Manual Drag**: Hover your mouse cursor between the column letters (e.g. between \\`A\\` and \\`B\\`) until it turns into a two-way arrow, then drag left or right.\n2. **AutoFit (The Double-Click Magic)**: Double-click the boundary line between two column headers. Excel will automatically resize the column to fit the widest text in that column perfectly!\n3. **Multi-Column AutoFit**: Click and drag across columns \\`A\\` through \\`F\\` to select them all, then double-click *any* divider to autofit all selected columns simultaneously.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Wrap Text vs Merging Cells\n- **Wrap Text**: Allows long text to break into multiple lines within a single cell, expanding the row height automatically.\n- **Alt + Enter (Manual Line Break)**: While editing text in a cell, press \\`Alt + Enter\\` to create an intentional new line inside the same cell.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **Pro Practice**: Avoid **Merge & Center**! Merged cells break formula references, sorting, and keyboard navigation. Use **Center Across Selection** or **Wrap Text** instead.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Hands-on Student Challenge\n1. In cell \\`A1\\`, type \\`Comprehensive Monthly Financial Report for Executive Leadership\\`.\n2. Notice how it overflows into B1 and C1.\n3. Select cell \\`A1\\` and click **Wrap Text** on the Home tab.\n4. AutoFit column \\`A\\` by double-clicking the column divider line.\n",
    "tags": "Excel, Lesson 08, Fundamentals, Beginner",
